## Conceptual probes vs lexical control (A-14)

Lexical-control templates copy the target page's own title, description or body phrases: title-paraphrase, title-variation, description-paraphrase, body-fuzzy, semantic-neighborhood. Conceptual probes use hand-authored synonyms or company neighborhoods.

